{"id":"blue-fruit","name":{"en":"Blue Fruit","ja":"青い実"},"desc":{"en":"A blue fruit that grows in clusters. Peel the skin for a blue surprise. You may think it's a creepy color for a fruit, but it is quite tasty.","ja":"房状に実った青い果物。皮を剥いても中まで 青い。ちょっと不気味な色合いだが、甘くて 中々美味しい。様々なデザートに使われ、特 にパイとの相性は抜群といわれている。"},"level":2,"locations":[{"id":"arland-great-plains","name":{"en":"Arland Great Plains","ja":"アーランド南方大平原"}},{"id":"outer-islets","name":{"en":"Outer Islets","ja":"外海諸島群"}},{"id":"golden-plains","name":{"en":"Golden Plains","ja":"黄金平原"},"parent":"arland-great-plains"}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"seasoning","name":{"en":"(Seasoning)","ja":"（調味料）"},"icon":"totori-category-seasoning"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":85}